 "text": "Hi, how have you been? Ask them about their school or work if it' still running, during the pandemic. Many schools don't charge and you get a day at a gym or zoo. Then a mini herb garden kit would give room of fresh parsley and few others. A basting dish of roast beef with peppercorn and rosemary is one way of showing off them. A travel journal is very cheap but loved. You can start with blank one and elixir cover. Or buy one and then have nice gift card for future journalling.",
